{"title":"Newly Launched","description":"\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"armour-smart-watch","title":"Zero Armour Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith Armour, experience a new world of exceptional visuals that makes everything clearer. 1.32” of LCD display and 500 nits brightness that truly transforms your \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eexperience.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":49817081053462,"sku":"23122","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49817081020694,"sku":"23024","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":45337362366742,"sku":"18971","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Teal Green","offer_id":45337362432278,"sku":"18972","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Misty Gray","offer_id":45337362399510,"sku":"18973","price":8499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/PSD01_02.webp?v=1742630454"},{"product_id":"z811-earbuds","title":"Z 811 Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet your all day audio companion with the best selling Z811 Earbuds giving you upto 50 Hours of Playtime, IPX5 Water Resistance with Quad Mic ENC, giving you the best in class features in a sleek flip design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Z 811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZ811 Earbuds: Your Ultimate Audio Companion\u003cbr\u003eExperience unparalleled sound quality and comfort with the Z811 earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e: Enjoy up to 50 hours of playtime on a single charge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCrystal-Clear Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our 13mm bass drivers deliver exceptional HD sound quality, ensuring you hear every detail of your music.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e: With Quad Mic ENC, enjoy crystal-clear calls and meetings without background noise interference.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstant Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our Bluetooth 5.3 technology ensures instant pairing with your device, so you can start listening right away.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: Get 120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes with our fast-charging technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e: The Z811's lightweight and ergonomic design provide a comfortable fit for all-day wear.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e: Our IPX5 water resistance rating ensures your earbuds can withstand sweat and light rain.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: Choose from our dual-toned soft matte rubber finish in multiple colors to match your style.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Easily activate your device's AI voice assistant with simple touch controls or voice commands.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Experience lag-free gaming with our 40ms low latency mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBreathing LED Lights\u003c\/strong\u003e: Add a touch of style with our breathing LED lights.\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade your audio experience today with the Z811 earbuds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Z811\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50 Hours Total Playback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Playback: 50 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFast Charging: 10min Charge = 120min Playtime Charging Port: C-type\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDriver: 13mm Audio codec: AAC, SBC High Fidelity Acosutics\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBT Version: 5.3 BT supported profile: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP Compatibility: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdded Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperbass™ Technology, 13mm Drivers | SBC, AAC Codec Supported\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Z811\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Z811 is the most reliable choice for your earbuds in the industry with a sleek design packed with audio leading features. It’s IPX5 Water Resistance ensures that your in-ear companion stays with you in every terrain with a battery life that lasts as long as you do!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"White","offer_id":46203584643350,"sku":"18544","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":46203584381206,"sku":"18510","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/811-white-1.webp?v=1733300591"},{"product_id":"ignite-smart-watch","title":"Ignite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eIgnite your style with Ignite Smart Watch: Boasting a 1.83\" TFT Display, 100+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; a unique Duo Colored Crown. Redefine your look with every touch!!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eIgnite Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart Watch\u003c\/a\u003e, available at ZeroLifestyle, combines cutting-edge technology with sleek design. Ideal for fitness enthusiasts and tech-savvy individuals, this smartwatch offers an array of features to keep you connected, healthy, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch features a vibrant full-color touch display, ensuring clear visibility in any lighting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and fitness tracking, you can stay on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe watch also includes a step counter and calorie tracker. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Ignite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch offers comprehensive tracking features to provide valuable insights into your daily activities and sleep patterns, helping you make informed health decisions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts ability to receive notifications directly on your wrist ensures you stay connected effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Ignite Smart Watch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":46752558317846,"sku":"19611","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069377462550,"sku":"19616","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey","offer_id":47069377495318,"sku":"19615","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46752557957398,"sku":"19612","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":46752558252310,"sku":"19613","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46752558285078,"sku":"19614","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ignite_black-1.webp?v=1773924771"},{"product_id":"luna-smart-watch","title":"Luna Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eSwitch towards infinite possibilities with the Luna Smartwatch, styled through a cosmic full metal body with a 1.39” HD Display and IP67 Water Resistance. With a fully functioning AI Assistant, Luna keeps you connected at every moment. Strap into the future of smartwatches with Active Weather Forecasting, BT Calling, and sleek strap designs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.39” HD Display\u003cbr\u003eIP67 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003eActive Weather Forecasting\u003cbr\u003eBT Calling\u003cbr\u003eSmart Notifications\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suites\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/stron