 and seamless Bluetooth connections for instant pairing, the Wave Earbuds are perfect for your day-to-day life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Wave:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10MM Big Bass Driver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47633617846550,"sku":"19085","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50303940985110,"sku":"23068","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown","offer_id":47633617879318,"sku":"19086","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47633617781014,"sku":"19087","price":3799.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/4_blue_20946955-541d-4b11-b046-2c569040eca9.webp?v=1786542878"},{"product_id":"aura-earbuds","title":"Zero Aura Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience sleekness like never before in your playlist with the Aura Earbuds, offering crystal clear quality through Quad Mic ENC and fully HD Spatial Audio to elevate every moment of your day..\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Aura:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e40 Hour Battery Life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAerofit Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperBass Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47721706488086,"sku":"20384","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47721884516630,"sku":"20458","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47721706520854,"sku":"20460","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":47721706553622,"sku":"20462","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/JX05-20.png?v=1757931373"},{"product_id":"drip","title":"Drip Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eDrip Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep up your tech game with the Drip Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make every day more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep up with your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOrder your Drip Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Drip Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Drip Smartwatch is loaded with features to keep you ahead of the game. Track your fitness goals with precision using advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered up throughout your busy day, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily switch up your style to suit any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Drip Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 390 x 390 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Drip SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Drip Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your lifestyle with its superior functionality and chic design. Its comprehensive health tracking, smart connectivity, and stylish aesthetics make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a seamless experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48217347850518,"sku":"20089","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":48217347916054,"sku":"20091","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":48217347948822,"sku":"20088","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48217347883286,"sku":"20085","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Gold_-1_bb04367a-a9f7-42c5-acef-05bd659db6c5.webp?v=1737804486"},{"product_id":"vision-smartwatch","title":"Vision Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVision Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the perfect blend of innovation and style with the Vision Smartwatch. Designed for your busy lifestyle, this smartwatch keeps you connected and efficient throughout the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith advanced technology and a sleek look, the Vision \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e offers both practicality and elegance in one wearable device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vision Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vision Smartwatch boasts an impressive suite of features designed to keep you at the top of your game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay healthy with comprehensive fitness tracking, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multi-sport modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected effortlessly with smart notifications for calls, messages, and apps right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts high-definition display ensures clarity and vibrancy, while the robust battery life keeps you powered for days.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomizable watch faces and straps let you personalize your smartwatch to suit any look, whether you're at the gym or a formal event.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vision Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Vision SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Vision Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your life in every possible way.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its advanced features, high-quality construction, and stylish design, this smartwatch is a standout in its category.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt not only helps you manage your health and stay connected but also complements your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur dedicated customer support ensures a seamless experience from purchase to everyday use, providing peace of mind with every wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48261650546966,"sku":"20147","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":48261650514198,"sku":"20148","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silver","offer_id":48261650612502,"sku":"20151","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48261650579734,"sku":"20150","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Beige Gold","offer_id":48261650678038,"sku":"20149","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/vision_Black_1.webp?v=1771398223"},{"product_id":"vogue-smartwatch","title":"Vogue Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVogue Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue Smartwatch from ZeroLifestyle is a perfect blend of style, functionality, and durability. Designed for fitness enthusiasts and busy professionals alike, this smartwatch offers a plethora of features to keep you connected and on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003ecomes with a vivid full-color touch display that remains clear even under bright sunlight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comfortable, lightweight strap ensures it can be worn all day. Key features include continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and tracking for various activities like walking, running, and cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a step counter and calorie tracker, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist, ensuring you never miss an important message.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: Suitable for intense workouts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48892245508374,"sku":"20684","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48892245377302,"sku":"20683","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Blue","offer_id":48892245475606,"sku":"20685","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48892245410070,"sku":"20687","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":48892245442838,"sku":"20686","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vogue_Silver_0000.webp?v=1742632877"},{"product_id":"rover-pro","title":"Rover Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the freedom in every beat with the Rover Pro’s Aerofit Design and 70-hour playtime, delivering crystal clarity of every sound with its HD audio quality and Instant Connectivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of the Rover Pro:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70 Hour Battery Life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAerofit Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperBass Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Matte Black","offer_id":48941158564118,"sku":"22371","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Deep Purple","offer_id":48941158596886,"sku":"22369","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Calm White","offer_id":48941158662422,"sku":"22365","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Electric Blue","offer_id":48941158531350,"sku":"22363","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Serene Blue","offer_id":48941158629654,"sku":"22367","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Angle-2_2.webp?v=1775900956"},{"product_id":"gravity","title":"Gravity Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eGravity Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of unparalleled audio quality with Gravity, the ultimate earbuds designed for those who demand the best in sound and style. Perfect for any lifestyle, these \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbuds \u003c\/a\u003ekeep you connected, deliver crystal-clear audio, and enhance your daily activities with ease..\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Gravity Earbuds:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGravity is equipped with state-of-the-art features to elevate your listening experience. Enjoy high-definition sound with deep bass and clear treble, ensuring an immersive audio experience. The noise isolation technology minimizes background noise, allowing you to focus on your music or calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with intuitive touch controls for easy management of calls, music, and voice assistants. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout the day, and the ergonomic design provides a secure and comfortable fit. The sweat and water-resistant build make it perfect for workouts and outdoor activities.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Gravity Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDriver Size: 12mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 6 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise isolation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 4g per earbud, 45g charging case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case: 350mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Gravity Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing Gravity means opting for a device that enhances your life with its superior functionality and stylish design. Its high-definition sound, smart touch controls, and ergonomic fit make it a standout choice. The robust build and advanced features ensure it meets the demands of any lifestyle. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a smooth experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Carbon Black","offer_id":48634514637078,"sku":"20382","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Soft Lilac","offer_id":48634514506006,"sku":"20494","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50374501433622,"sku":"22832","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl Pink","offer_id":48634514538774,"sku":"20498","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ice Blue","offer_id":48634514604310,"sku":"20496","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":48634514571542,"sku":"20492","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_b33187c4-bd27-4682-9fdf-0bd11c597370.webp?v=1785850205"},{"product_id":"sigma-smartwatch","title":"Sigma Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe All New Sigma gives your lifestyle a new dimension in Smartwatches with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display paired with a Textured Silicon Strap and a fully functioning Rotating Crown enabled with Smart Notifications, Smart Workout Modes, Health Suite and 100+ Smartwatch Faces, AI Assistant and a 5 Day Battery Life Without Charge to level up your daily activities!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Sigma:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sigma is embossed with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display\u003cbr\u003eFully Rotating Crown \u003cbr\u003eA Textured Silicon Strap with complete health tracking, workout modes and smart notifications for BT Calling, Text Messaging and AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Sigma:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Orange Titanium","offer_id":48864495763734,"sku":"20562","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":48864495665430,"sku":"20561","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Black","offer_id":48864495730966,"sku":null,"price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Titanium","offer_id":48864495796502,"sku":"20563","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Black","offer_id":48864495698198,"sku":"20564","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/2_d3c6b345-499c-4556-803e-4c31aef81269.webp?v=1760354528"},{"product_id":"carbon-earbuds","title":"Carbon Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds with super loud sound and Environmental Noise Cancellation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCarbon Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover unparalleled sound quality with Carbon Earbuds. These earbuds are designed for those who seek both high-performance audio and comfort. Ideal for any activity, Carbon Earbuds deliver an outstanding listening experience whether you're on the go or at home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarbon Earbuds provide rich, immersive sound with enhanced bass and clear treble. With built-in noise reduction, you can enjoy your music without interruption.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lightweight and ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, while touch controls allow for easy music and call management. The long-lasting battery life ensures you stay connected longer, and the sleek charging case provides additional power for extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Carbon Earbuds\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 hours (up to 28 hours with charging case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNoise Cancellation: Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaterproof Rating: IPX5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 50g (with case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Carbon Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuantum Earbuds provide exceptional sound quality and comfort, making them the perfect choice for any audio lover. With advanced features like noise cancellation and long battery life, these earbuds stand out in the market. The sleek and modern design adds a touch of style to your audio experience, making them suitable for any setting. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48768395870486,"sku":"20392","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Dark Green","offer_id":48768395903254,"sku":"20482","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Light Gray","offer_id":48768395936022,"sku":"20480","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/JX98-01.webp?v=1765806286"},{"product_id":"elite-smart-watch","title":"Elite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"pin-spacer\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite smartwatch is a testament to innovation and style. Boasting a stunning 2.04\" AMOLED display, it delivers a visual experience like no other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eElite Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eZero Smartwatch\u003c\/a\u003e combines high-tech features with a stylish design. Perfect for those who want both performance and elegance, this smartwatch helps you stay connected, track your health, and improve your daily routine. Whether you're at work, the gym, or out with friends, the Elite Smartwatch fits effortlessly into your life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch comes with a robust set of features to keep you ahead. Track your fitness with precision using its advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and multiple sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, texts, and apps, all visible on a clear, high-resolution display. The long-lasting battery ensures you’re always ready for action, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily match your watch to your outfit and mood.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Elite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 400 x 400 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 47 x 39 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Elite SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Elite Smartwatch stands out with its powerful features and stylish design, making it the perfect choice for anyone looking to enhance their lifestyle. Its extensive health tracking, smart connectivity, and customizable design set it apart in the smartwatch market. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight","offer_id":48944557818134,"sku":"20610","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":48944557785366,"sku":"20611","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48944557850902,"sku":"20609","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Black_1.webp?v=1725950686"},{"product_id":"wave-pro","title":"Wave Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"53542514-04a7-447c-b6a1-c81cd58127bc\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro Earbuds represent the next generation of in-ear audio, delivering an unparalleled HD sound experience with over 100 hours of playback time. As the industry's first powerhouse earbuds with such longevity, Wave Pro stands out with 5 dual-toned, soft matte finishes, seamlessly blending superior audio performance with cutting-edge style that perfectly matches your fashion sense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro offers an industry-leading 100 hours of playback time, powered by 13mm Bass Drivers that deliver crystal-clear HD sound. Equipped with Quad Mic ENC, the earbuds ensure premium call quality and effective noise cancellation, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Bluetooth 5.3 and Insta-Pair technology, the Wave Pro connects to your device instantly, and a quick charge of just 10 minutes provides 120 minutes of playback. The lightweight, ergonomic design with rounded monochrome tips ensures all-day comfort, while the soft matte, dual-tone rubber finish adds both style and enhanced grip for easy carrying.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro also features AI Voice Assistant with touch controls for seamless hands-free operation. Whether you're using \"Hey Siri\" for iOS or \"Ok Google\" for Android, activating your assistant is as easy as tapping or holding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Wave Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDrivers\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm Hyperbass™ Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLatency\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adaptive Low Latency\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 10-minute charge = 120 minutes of playtime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/strong\u003e: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Quad Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs\u003c\/strong\u003e: AAC, SBC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Fidelity Acoustics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSupported Profiles\u003c\/strong\u003e: A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, HSP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/strong\u003e: Android \u0026amp; iOS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHyperbass™ Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Wave Pro?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Wave Pro merges fast fashion with disruptive technology. Boasting the largest battery capacity in the industry, superior sound quality, and a sleek dual-tone matte finish, these earbuds are a perfect balance of performance and style. The Wave Pro isn’t just an accessory—it’s a reliable companion that elevates both your listening experience and your sense of style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Orange Black","offer_id":49286916931862,"sku":"22481","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Gray","offer_id":49286910017814,"sku":"22539","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lilic Gray","offer_id":49286909985046,"sku":"22615","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":49286909952278,"sku":"22613","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":50027537662230,"sku":"23070","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Ecommerce-Image-1.webp?v=1729196999"},{"product_id":"arcade-900","title":"Zero Arcade 900","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Arcade Series Gaming Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePakistan’s First Gaming Earbuds, making it the ultimate wireless companion for every gamer. Powered with 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, RGB Case \u0026amp; Buds along with 50 Hour Standby Playback time, the Arcade Series is your gaming studio in your pocket.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience true wireless freedom without any lagging with The Arcade Series 40M\/S Hyper Low Latency, giving you reliable connections at ultra-fast speed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRGB Case \u0026amp; Buds:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your victory, wherever and whenever with the Arcade Series’ sleek design paired with RGB LED lights in your case and earbuds, making a style statement for every gamer.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncredible Audio Immersion:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy high-resolution audio with 10MM HyperBass Drivers, transporting you to your in-game environment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUnbeatable Battery Life with Ultra Fast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e With 50 hours standby playback, your gaming sessions never end. Power up with ultra-fast charging, giving you 120 minutes of playback in just 10 minutes!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Gaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eENC \u0026amp; Quad Mic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHyper Low Latency:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAI Voice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suitable for intense workouts.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Arcade 900\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re looking for the true wireless experience to enhance your gaming, whether you’re at home, on the go, or in your studio, then the Arcade Series is a must-have for every gamer. Even if you’re not into gaming and just looking for something to stream, the Arcade Series offers over 50 hours of playback battery with HyperBass audio, giving you the vibes you want in every beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49399249305878,"sku":"22436","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":49399249338646,"sku":"22503","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Arcade-900-Black-7.webp?v=1771069079"},{"product_id":"crown-smartwatch","title":"Crown Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eCrown Smart Watch Product Description\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience technology that’s beyond luxury with the all-new Crown Smartwatch packed with features that are never before seen in the industry with a Vegan Leather Strap that is resistant to wrinkles, sweat and tears and powered with the industry’s first True Always On Ultra AMOLED Display resting on a chrome plated dial, making the Crown a benchmark of luxury with the latest technology, all on your wrist!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"features\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrue Always On Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experience Full Vibrance of Your Live Watch Face Always Activated On Your Wrist Resembling A Classic Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWrinkle Free Vegan Leather Strap:\u003c\/strong\u003e Industry’s First Luxury Smartwatch That’s Made For Activity With A Vegan Leather Strap That is Resistant to Wrinkles, Tears and is Sweat \u0026amp; Splash Proof\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1.43” Ultra AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e Immerse in the true vibrance of 600 NITS Brightness a 1.43” ULTRA AMOLED Display making every bezel beyond imagination\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Suite:\u003c\/strong\u003e Receive calls, texts, and social media alerts along with Stock Market Updates and choose from 100+ Workout Modes making the Crown your ultimate companion in luxury\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"specifications\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ultra AMOLED Display, 600 Nits Brightness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Steps, calories, various exercise modes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multiple customizable watch faces.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"why-choose\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Crown Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Crown isn’t just a choice, it’s a testament of luxury that’s built for those who don’t compromise on their lifestyle with a Chrome Plated Finish, an Ultra AMOLED Display and a smart screen that’s Always On to display your statement, the Crown empowers your wrist with features beyond belief. Moreover, the Crown with its wrinkle free Vegan Leather Strap and over a 100 Workout Modes, this \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis your wrist’s companion for every walk of life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":49454925873430,"sku":"22772","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":49454925840662,"sku":"22773","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49454925807894,"sku":"20912","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49454961754390,"sku":"20913","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/STRAP01.webp?v=1754740631"},{"product_id":"revoltt-pro-smartwatch","title":"Revoltt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRevolttt Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe revolttt Pro is a cutting-edge smartwatch designed to seamlessly blend health, connectivity, and style. Featuring a sleek AMOLED display, it provides crystal-clear visuals and exceptional battery life, allowing you to stay connected for up to 5 days with a single charge. Whether you're tracking your heart rate, monitoring your sleep, or controlling your music, the revoltt Pro brings modern tech to your wrist with a sporty design that suits every lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Revolttt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revolttt Pro combines performance and style with an AMOLED display (1.43 inches, 466x466 resolution) for vibrant visuals and easy navigation across 8 menu styles. Equipped with Bluetooth 5.3, it offers seamless connectivity for calls, messaging alerts, and synchronization with your phone’s contact list.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003efeatures multiple health monitoring functions, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep monitoring, and more, ensuring you stay on top of your health at all times. The built-in Google and Siri Voice Assistants offer added convenience, while the diverse sports modes and the ability to control music directly from the watch make it perfect for both fitness and entertainment enthusiasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a water resistance rating of IP67, a durable metal and plastic body, and a stainless steel strap, the Revoltt Pro is both stylish and functional. Plus, with up to 5 days of battery life, you can keep up with your busy schedule without constant recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 1.43 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 466 x 466\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling Chip: Single chip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransmission Range: 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contact Book\/Calls: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate: HX3605\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking (female): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 150 minutes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 480 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 671927\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: 2-pins magnet cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePhysical Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 55.00*49.00*14.00 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: Metal + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 66g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud, 5+1 Built-in, Animated Support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 5 Cloud, 107 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanguages: 12+ (including English, Spanish, French, Arabic, etc.)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (Flappy Bird, 2048, Whack-A-Mole, Thunder Fighter)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistants: Google, Siri\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther Features: Alarm, Flash Light, Calculator, DND Mode, Pedometer, Sedentary Reminder, Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Revoltt Pro\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Revoltt Pro is your ultimate wrist companion for fitness, productivity, and entertainment. Its stylish, durable design, along with robust health tracking capabilities and seamless connectivity, makes it the ideal choice for those who demand the best in wearable tech. Whether you're at the gym, in a meeting, or on the go, the Revoltt Pro keeps you connected, healthy, and in control.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gun Metal","offer_id":49534031266070,"sku":"22409","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":49534031200534,"sku":"22411","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Champagne Gold","offer_id":49534031167766,"sku":"22407","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49534031233302,"sku":"22805","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_14d4c7f7-c21c-49be-8519-5f340b58ebd5.webp?v=1734007033"},{"product_id":"vibe-earbuds","title":"Vibe Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eEarbuds Specification\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Black, white, green, blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Form: In-ear\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAudio\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudible Unit: F11\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: 20Hz-20,000Hz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpedance: 32Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitivity: 110±3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudio Decoding: SBC\/AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Platform: 5.4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Distance: ＞10m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection Way: Bluetooth link\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Specification: JL6973D4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Protocol: HSP\/HFP\/A2DP\/AVRCP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaster Slave Switch: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eBattery Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Input Type: Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBox Input Power: 5V-300mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBox Output Power: 5V-140mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Batteries Capacity: 40mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Battery Capacity: 450mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Play Time: 40h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying Time: 7h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 300 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: Headphones 45 minutes, charging case 1.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003ePhysical Specification\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Proof: IPX4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWake up Siri \/ Google Assistant: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitive Touch: Built-in touchpad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBoost: The battery controls the elevating voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurn off: Put in the charging compartment, shut down and enter the charging state\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlay\/Pause: In the music state, double-click any headset button once\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Back: Long press left ear for 2 seconds to start\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Forward: Long press the right ear for 2 seconds for the next song\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume+: Click the right ear to add\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume-: Click the left ear to subtract\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri \/ Google Assistant: Three touches on either side of the headset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Latency MS: 120ms\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHang up: In call status, double-click any headset to hang up\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnswer Call: When an incoming call comes in, click any headset to answer the call\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReject Call: Press and hold for about 2 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFactory Reset: In the off state, hold down the touch button for 8 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49548913312022,"sku":"22649","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":49548913279254,"sku":"23234","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Storm Green","offer_id":49548913213718,"sku":"23233","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49548913246486,"sku":"23232","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vibe_4_5db79883-9794-4d19-9fa6-f75dcb7ceb3c.webp?v=1734557297"},{"product_id":"jaguar","title":"Jaguar Smart Watch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Jaguar Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with sleek design to offer a premium wearable experience. Equipped with a 1.96-inch TFT display, this smartwatch delivers sharp visuals and easy navigation. It boasts a range of health tracking features such as heart rate monitoring, blood pressure tracking, and SP02 measurement, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. With extended battery life, a variety of smart features like music control, camera access, and weather updates, as well as a sturdy zinc alloy body, the Jaguar \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is the perfect blend of functionality and style for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek, square design with an impressive 1.96-inch TFT display.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive health monitoring features, including heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, sleep tracking, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffers customizable watch faces, with both cloud-based and built-in options.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports multiple sports modes for an active lifestyle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced smart features like music control, camera control, weather updates, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.96 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: TFT\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 240x282\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Transmission Range: 8-10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Application Support (Android\/iOS): Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: Magnet\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: 552022-250mAH\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Time: 3 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: About 7-9 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: About 20 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShape: Square\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Body Material: Zinc Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Material: Silica Gel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 40.8g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance Rating: IP67\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Monitoring Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSP02 Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Female Function: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOxygen Monitor: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 100+ Cloud-based, 7+1 Static, Support Animated Faces, DIY Watch Face\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 123 Built-in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultilingual Support: 27+ Languages\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGames: 4 (2048, Floppy, Hamster, Battleship)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOTA Firmware Upgrade: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri Assistance: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic: Control and Play Music from Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlash Light: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalculator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLCD Lightness Adjustment: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheater Mode\/DND Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePedometer: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary Reminder: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrink Water Reminder: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMotion Gesture Display Activation: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eText Messages Notification: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncoming Call\/Messaging Alert: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynchronize Contacts and Call Records: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSplit Screen: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFind Device\/Find Mobile Phone: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheme Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopwatch\/Countdown: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jaguar Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep track of essential health metrics such as heart rate, blood pressure, SP02, and sleep, ensuring that you stay informed about your well-being.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay connected with easy access to music, camera control, voice assistant (Siri), and a wide range of notifications right from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy up to 9 days of battery life on a single charge, ensuring reliability for daily use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Stylish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a zinc alloy body and water resistance rating of IP67, the Jaguar Smartwatch combines style with robustness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49616248373526,"sku":"20918","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Silver Metal","offer_id":49616248537366,"sku":"20919","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Metal","offer_id":49616248439062,"sku":"20920","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Orange","offer_id":49616248406294,"sku":"20923","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Orange","offer_id":49616248471830,"sku":"20921","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Orange","offer_id":49616248504598,"sku":"20922","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jaguar_1_1_d75eb334-0550-4b21-8804-eba296365658.webp?v=1762935821"},{"product_id":"icon-smartwatch","title":"Icon Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eIcon Smartwatch Overview\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Icon Smartwatch combines advanced technology with a sleek design, offering a premium wearable experience. Equipped with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display, this smartwatch provides clear visuals and easy navigation. It features a range of health tracking capabilities such as dynamic heart rate monitoring, SpO2 measurement, and sleep tracking, helping you maintain your fitness goals. With an impressive battery life and a variety of smart features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications, the Icon Smartwatch is the perfect blend of functionality and style for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStylish design with a 1.38-inch TFT HD display.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive health monitoring features, including dynamic heart rate, SpO2, sleep tracking, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffers customizable watch faces with 4 built-in options and 100+ cloud-based watch faces.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports multiple sports modes for an active lifestyle.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmart watches\u003c\/a\u003e features like quick dial pad, camera control, smart notifications, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.38 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: TFT HD Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Chip BT Calling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 7 Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysical Specifications:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShape: Square\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance Rating: IP68\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRadiant Brightness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Monitoring Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFemale Health Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 4 Built-in, 100+ Cloud-based\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 100+\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Dial Pad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm, Timer, Stopwatch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Icon Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring:\u003c\/strong\u003e Keep track of essential health metrics such as heart rate, SpO2, and sleep, ensuring that you stay informed about your well-being.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay connected with features like quick dial pad, camera control, and smart notifications right from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Stylish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a sleek design and water resistance rating of IP68, the Icon Smartwatch combines style with robustness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49669428314390,"sku":"22851","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49669428379926,"sku":"22853","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space Blue","offer_id":49669428347158,"sku":"22852","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49669428412694,"sku":"22856","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":49669428445462,"sku":"22877","price":7499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/b1.webp?v=1755342500"},{"product_id":"regal-smartwatch","title":"Regal AI Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Regal Smartwatch is an elegant fusion of style and innovation. Its sleek, modern design and durable construction make it a versatile accessory for any occasion, whether you're at work, out casually, or hitting the gym.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sleek, modern finish with sturdy construction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch screen with customizable menu views.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use and up to 25–30 days on standby. Quick 2-hour charging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e107 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"display-earbuds","title":"Display Earbuds","description":"\u003ch3\u003eDisplay Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine cutting-edge technology with sleek design, offering superior sound, unmatched comfort, and innovative smart features. Whether you’re looking to elevate your music, calls, or gaming experience, these earbuds are designed to meet every need, offering the ultimate in wireless freedom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Design Meets Everyday Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e: Available in four stunning colors—Black, Blue, Green, and Champagne. Designed for a snug and secure fit, offering unmatched comfort even during extended use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImmersive Sound Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding with a quad-microphone ENC system for premium sound quality in music and calls, even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Smart Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Built into the charging case for easy browsing, managing, and customizing settings. Select wallpapers, music, set timers, and more on a single screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnboard Storage\u003c\/strong\u003e: 100 minutes of onboard audio storage allows you to enjoy your favorite tracks anywhere, anytime, without a phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Day Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours of playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with the charging case. Fast-charging technology ensures a full charge in just 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4 with Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, and Hyper Sync technology for lag-free performance up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow-Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e: Ultra-low latency of 50–60 ms for smooth and responsive gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e: Simple gestures for play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, activate Siri\/Google Assistant, and enter Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt for Your Active Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4 water resistance rating for workouts, light rain, or everyday adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Display Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Black, Blue, Green, Champagne.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c\/strong\u003e: High-definition audio decoding, quad-microphone ENC system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: 6 hours playtime on a single charge, 30 hours total with case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 hour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.4, Popup Pairing, Auto-Pairing, Hyper Sync technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInteractive Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e: Settings customization, battery status check, wallpaper selection, music browsing, timers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control\u003c\/strong\u003e: Play\/pause, volume control, skip tracks, Siri\/Google Assistant activation, Game Mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Rating\u003c\/strong\u003e: IPX4.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"\u003e\u003c!-- [if !supportLists]--\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e·\u003cspan style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\"\u003e         \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003cspan dir=\"LTR\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Accessories\u003c\/strong\u003e: Display Earbuds, charging case with interactive smart screen, custom-fit eartips, USB charging cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Zero Lifestyle Display Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Display Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle combine premium performance with cutting-edge features and effortless style. Offering all-day comfort, hassle-free pairing, low-latency gaming, and a customizable smart screen, these earbuds are designed to enhance every moment of your day. Whether you’re streaming, gaming, or enjoying music on the go without your phone, the Display Earbuds provide the ultimate in wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Metallic Black","offer_id":49791717409046,"sku":"23206","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic White","offer_id":49791608783126,"sku":"23204","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Blue","offer_id":49791608717590,"sku":"23200","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Metallic Green","offer_id":49791608684822,"sku":"23198","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Metallic Beige","offer_id":49791608750358,"sku":"23202","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/brown.webp?v=1741777839"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"jewel-smartwatch","title":"Jewel Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eJewel Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExquisitely engineered with a robust Zinc alloy shell combined with PC and ABS elements. Available in two variants—Jewel (with a lightweight profile of 30g\/44g strap options) and Jewel SE (83g with a premium steel band)—this smartwatch is built to complement your style without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy a 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with a crisp 360×360 resolution that delivers vibrant visuals and excellent clarity for day-to-day interactions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by a polymer battery (230mAh), the Jewel \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eoffers 5–7 days of active use alongside up to 20 days on standby. A swift charge in just 2 hours gets you back on track without missing a beat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts directly from your wrist. With seamless contact synchronization, call records, and split-screen functionalities, the Jewel Smartwatch ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomize your experience using over 300 cloud-based watch faces—with 5 built-in options and DIY support—and choose from 110+ sports modes (8 built-in). Additional smart tools include voice assistant support through Google Assistant and Siri, camera control for capturing life’s moments, weather updates, alarms, calculator, LCD brightness adjustments, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture activation, and essential reminders for sedentary behavior and hydration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: 1.1-inch AMOLED screen with 360×360 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: 5–7 days of active use, 20 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating System: Compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 10+ (supporting Bluetooth 4.0).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: BLE 5.0 with a 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Smartwatch offers an extraordinary blend of aesthetics, functionality, and smart connectivity. Whether you choose the classic Jewel or the premium Jewel SE, its refined design, comprehensive health tracking, and plethora of everyday tools ensure that you remain connected and in control—no matter if you’re working out, working hard, or winding down at the end of the day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden Milannese","offer_id":49924661870870,"sku":"22900","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Metal","offer_id":49924662001942,"sku":"22902","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Metal","offer_id":49924662034710,"sku":"22910","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Leather","offer_id":49924661936406,"sku":"22906","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White Leather","offer_id":49924661903638,"sku":"22904","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Milannese","offer_id":49924662067478,"sku":"22908","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Milannese","offer_id":49924661838102,"sku":"22896","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Metal","offer_id":49924661969174,"sku":"22898","price":11999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Jewel_1_57b8f293-03c2-46be-9f76-79cf4af38c09.webp?v=1773449006"},{"product_id":"storm","title":"Storm Headphones","description":"\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Storm Headphones\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones are equipped with a robust 750mAh battery, delivering up to 70 hours of continuous playback at 60% volume and an impressive standby time of up to 6000 hours. A full recharge takes just 2–3 hours, ensuring your music experience remains uninterrupted.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBluetooth 5.0 Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience seamless wireless audio with Bluetooth V5.0 technology, offering a stable connection within a 10-meter range. The dual pairing feature allows you to connect and switch effortlessly between two devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSimple Pairing Process\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo pair, press and hold the Multi-Function Button (MFB) for 3 seconds until the LED indicator flashes red and blue, signaling pairing mode. Select \"Storm\" from your device's Bluetooth menu and enter “0000” if prompted. Once paired, the headphones will automatically reconnect to the device when in range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHands-Free Convenience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eControl your music and calls with intuitive touch features. Play\/pause, answer\/reject calls, skip tracks, and adjust volume—all at your fingertips. Activate Siri or Google Assistant by holding the MFB for 2 seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWired Option Available\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSwitch to wired mode using a 3.5mm AUX cable to conserve battery. Inserting the cable disables wireless functions, offering greater versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAudio Quality \u0026amp; Calling\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e40mm drivers deliver dynamic sound with a frequency range of 20Hz–20KHz and 32Ω impedance. The built-in microphone with -38dB±3dB sensitivity ensures clear calls and voice assistant interaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCharging Indicator\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging via micro-USB is straightforward. A red LED lights up while charging and turns off once the battery is fully charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours (at 60% volume)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6000 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2–3 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 750mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20Hz–20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (Siri \/ Google Assistant)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAUX Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes (3.5mm cable)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Indicator:\u003c\/strong\u003e Red LED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 181g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, Champagne\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Storm Headphones?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Storm Headphones offer a powerful audio experience, extended battery life, dual Bluetooth connectivity, and smart touch controls in a sleek, stylish package. Whether you're streaming music, taking calls, or using voice assistants, these headphones adapt effortlessly to your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50007641194774,"sku":"22913","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50724668408086,"sku":"24048","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":50007641227542,"sku":"22914","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red","offer_id":50724668440854,"sku":"24142","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50007641162006,"sku":"22912","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"White","offer_id":50007641260310,"sku":"22915","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/black_1_bdf97883-4dd7-4609-8119-aae71f0f5e9c.webp?v=1747123777"},{"product_id":"arcade-beast","title":"Arcade Beast","description":"\u003ch2 data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"109\"\u003eArcade Beast by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"111\" data-end=\"134\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"168\"\u003eSleek and Tactical Design\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"293\"\u003eBuilt for both performance and style, the \u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e earbuds come in four bold colorways—Black, Grey, Blue, and White.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"353\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"315\"\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"383\"\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions are 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"506\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 44.53 g ensures a snug and effortless fit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"557\"\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"640\"\u003eGame, stream, and talk all day with powerful battery support and quick recharging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"663\"\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 30 hours of usage time\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"760\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"724\"\u003eSingle Charge Playback:\u003c\/strong\u003e Around 6 hours at moderate volume\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"815\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"781\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"834\"\u003ePower Setup:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"865\"\u003eType-C Input: DC 5V\/1A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"892\"\u003eCase Input Power: 5W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eCase Output: 1.2W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"939\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"937\"\u003eBattery Specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"960\"\u003eEarbuds: 40mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"979\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"979\"\u003eCase: 400mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1051\"\u003eBattery Manufacturer: Golden Universe \/ Henan Wanli \/ Hunan Lirui\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1071\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 40 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1204\"\u003eStay connected with ultra-reliable Bluetooth and real-time responsiveness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1269\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1230\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4 for faster, more stable pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1332\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1295\"\u003eConnectivity Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Operates smoothly within 10 meters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1364\"\u003ePersonalized Device Name:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recognized as “\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"227\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e”\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1422\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1448\"\u003eAdvanced Protocols:\u003c\/strong\u003e A2DP 1.4, AVRCP 1.6.2, HFP 1.7.2, and more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1517\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1515\"\u003eSmart Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eAuto Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1556\"\u003ePopup Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003eHyper Sync\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1600\"\u003eMaster-Slave Switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Voice Activation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1700\"\u003eTake control with effortless taps and voice commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1724\"\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Activate Siri or Google Assistant with four taps on the left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1865\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1819\"\u003eTouch Interaction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface for easy control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eQuick Pairing \u0026amp; Smart Sync:\u003c\/strong\u003e Pair instantly without digging into settings\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1985\"\u003eImmersive Audio \u0026amp; Durability\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2038\"\u003eEngineered for powerful sound clarity and endurance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2062\"\u003eDriver Platform:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by JL 7006F8 chip for clean, balanced audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2152\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2136\"\u003eAudio Format:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2233\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2176\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Splash-ready for daily wear (IPX rating not specified)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2269\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2295\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.3 × 20.4 × 20 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2373\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2349\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 58.1 × 45.8 × 27.3 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2403\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2393\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 44.53 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2433\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2424\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 hour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2465\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2458\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e V5.4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2521\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2489\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40mAh (earbud), 400mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2542\"\u003ePlayback Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6 hours (single charge), 30 hours total\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2609\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2650\"\u003eArcade Beast Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2668\"\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2692\"\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2716\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2751\"\u003eWhy Choose Arcade Beast?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"3019\"\u003eLevel up your lifestyle with \u003cstrong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2798\"\u003eArcade Beast\u003c\/strong\u003e—a bold fusion of form, power, and real-time audio performance. Built for gamers, streamers, and go-getters, these earbuds are your companion for every battle, beat drop, and call. Plug in. Lock on. Beast Mode: Activated.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Stealth Black","offer_id":50134811410710,"sku":"22932","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Thunder Blue","offer_id":50134811443478,"sku":"22936","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Convert White","offer_id":50134811377942,"sku":"22934","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gaming black","offer_id":51154447302934,"sku":"25001","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ECOM_01.webp?v=1774945163"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"snap-zbuds","title":"Snap Zbuds","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"18\"\u003eSnap Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eThe Snap Zbuds are engineered for music lovers and multitaskers who want powerful sound, effortless controls, and all-day comfort. With immersive audio, long-lasting battery, and seamless connectivity, Snap Zbuds are your go-to earbuds for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"344\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic earbuds with a sleek charging case for easy portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"560\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eImmersive Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – 12 mm dynamic drivers with SBC and AAC decoding deliver rich, balanced sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"681\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"610\"\u003e7 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e of playtime on a single charge and \u003cstrong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\"\u003e29 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"778\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\"\u003eQuick Charging \u0026amp; USB‑C Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\"\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"891\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with 10 m range, quick auto‑pairing, and master‑slave switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eClear Calls Anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual MEMS microphones with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for crystal‑clear conversations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\"\u003eTouch Controls \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, switch tracks, and activate Siri\/Google Assistant with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1224\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to withstand sweat and light rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1264\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27.39 × 25.01 × 23.02 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66 × 43.7 × 32 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1385\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30.42 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 mAh (earbuds) + 480 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1471\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7 hours (single charge) \/ 29 hours (total)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1568\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours via USB‑C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (10 m range)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1647\"\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jieli7016\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003eAudio Driver:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 mm dynamic driver\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 Hz – 20 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 112.5 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\"\u003eDecoding Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1857\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual MEMS Mic\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eNoise Cancellation:\u003c\/strong\u003e ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 (splash‑proof)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\"\u003eWhy Choose Snap Zbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2409\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eSnap Zbuds are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re your all‑day companion for calls, music, and workouts. With powerful audio, reliable ENC for clear calls, and a compact design, they’re built for every moment. Whether you’re commuting, hitting the gym, or just unwinding, Snap Zbuds keep you connected and entertained without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Lavender Haze","offer_id":50335110660374,"sku":"23427","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cool Grey","offer_id":50335110627606,"sku":"23425","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":50335110693142,"sku":"23426","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Lavendar-Haze_2.webp?v=1771238203"},{"product_id":"luna-pro","title":"Luna Pro","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuna Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch blends modern design with powerful health and lifestyle features, delivering a premium experience for everyday life. With advanced sensors, fitness tracking, and a customizable interface, Luna Pro keeps you connected, informed, and in control—wherever your day takes you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy middle frame with PC plastic bottom case and anti-static z\u003cspan\u003einc alloy frame\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.38-inch TFT round screen with 240×240 resolution and full-screen touch support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – 220 mAh polymer battery provides \u003cstrong\u003e5–7 days of regular use\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e10–15 days standby\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via magnetic USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, notifications, music control, and remote camera function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–8:00)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Supports walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, and swimming, with GPS motion tracking via the \u003cstrong\u003eDaFit app\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – 4 pre-installed dials, 1 DIY custom face, and more available in the watch face market.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Assistant \u0026amp; Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e – AI voice assistant, alarm, calculator, stopwatch, weather updates, sedentary and drink reminders, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong\u003eIP68 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, making it safe for daily use and light water exposure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy frame + PC bottom + silicone strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38-inch TFT, 240×240 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e JIELI 7012F6\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e RAM 640 KB \/ ROM 64 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e LC09 heart rate sensor, Minghao DA267 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 mAh polymer battery (5–7 days use, 10–15 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3, supports calls, music control, notifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, swimming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c\/strong\u003e DaFit (Android 5.0 + \/ iOS 9.0 +)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtra Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e AI voice assistant, remote camera, DIY watch face, split‑screen, built‑in game, OTA updates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Luna Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch is designed for users who demand performance, style, and versatility. From \u003cstrong\u003ehealth monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003esmartphone connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines everyday convenience with fitness intelligence. With customizable watch faces, extended battery life, and IP68 water resistance, Luna Pro is more than a smartwatch—it’s your all‑day companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50337766244630,"sku":"23118","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":50337766277398,"sku":"23120","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKWATCHFACE.webp?v=1755331884"},{"product_id":"crystal-earbuds","title":"Crystal Earbuds","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCrystal Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrystal Earbuds bring together sleek style, powerful sound, and smart functionality. Designed for comfort and performance, they deliver immersive audio, crystal‑clear calls, and effortless connectivity—perfect for everyday listening, work, and play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; Stylish Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compact earbuds with a total weight of just \u003cstrong\u003e39 g\u003c\/strong\u003e, perfect for all‑day wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong\u003eRich Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual microphones with \u003cstrong\u003e4‑mic ENC noise reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e ensure clear calls and balanced audio.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy \u003cstrong\u003e5–6 hours of playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e per charge and up to \u003cstrong\u003e20–24 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e1–2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via USB‑C.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.4 with auto‑pairing and low‑latency support for a smooth wireless experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Voice Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Works with Siri and Google Assistant for hands‑free control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, volume control, track skipping, and call management with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Safe from sweat and light rain during workouts or daily commutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 39 g (earbuds + case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 mAh × 2 (earbuds) + 400 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–6 hours (single charge) \/ 20–24 hours (with case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 120 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1–2 hours (5 V\/300 mA input)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4 (range \u0026gt; 10 m)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e AAC, SBC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.4 GHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32 Ω ± 10%\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 105 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual mic setup with 4‑mic ENC noise cancellation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlay\/Pause – Single tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNext Song – Double tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrevious Song – Double tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVolume + – Long press right earbud (2 sec)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVolume – Long press left earbud (2 sec)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVoice Assistant – Tap either earbud 3 times\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnswer\/Hang Up Call – Single tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Crystal Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrystal Earbuds are built for people who value both style and substance. With \u003cstrong\u003epowerful ENC noise reduction, low‑latency connectivity, and long‑lasting battery life\u003c\/strong\u003e, they are perfect for calls, music, and on‑the‑go convenience. Sleek, comfortable, and packed with features, Crystal Earbuds redefine your everyday listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Pure Black","offer_id":50337770373398,"sku":"22538","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rich Brown","offer_id":50337770406166,"sku":"23056","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Aqua Blue","offer_id":50337770307862,"sku":"23058","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Coral","offer_id":50337770340630,"sku":"23054","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Crystal-Black_4.webp?v=1754053603"},{"product_id":"j-10c-earbuds","title":"J-10C Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"241\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"241\"\u003eJ-10 C Limited Edition Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"261\"\u003eJ-10 C Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are a special tribute to the Pakistan Air Force’s historic 6-0 victory over India—a moment of pride, power, and precision. Engineered for performance and crafted with sleek design, they blend immersive audio, military-grade clarity, and everyday comfort for champions at heart.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"544\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"577\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"694\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"616\"\u003eLimited Edition Tribute Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Inspired by the spirit of victory and valor, celebrating PAF's 6-0 triumph.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"805\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"722\"\u003eCrystal‑Clear Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quad-mic ENC noise reduction for rich, balanced sound and superior call clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"917\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"834\"\u003eLong-Lasting Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy 5–6 hours of continuous play and up to 20–24 hours with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"992\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"944\"\u003eFast USB-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharges in 1–2 hours via USB-C input.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1112\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003eStable Bluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth, low-latency connectivity with support for AAC\/SBC audio decoding and 10m+ range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1214\"\u003e🎮 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1138\"\u003eGame Mode Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Activate low latency with 4 quick taps for competitive audio performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eSmart Assistant Enabled\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compatible with Siri and Google Assistant for seamless voice control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1412\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1352\"\u003eResponsive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Manage music, calls, and volume with effortless gestures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1511\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\"\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Resistant to sweat and light rain—ideal for commutes and workouts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1551\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1551\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"2069\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1564\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 45 g (earbuds + case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1610\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 mAh × 2 (earbuds) + 700 mAh (case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1651\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1664\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–6 hours (single charge) \/ 20–24 hours (with case)\u003cbr data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1719\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1736\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 120 hours\u003cbr data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1749\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1767\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1–2 hours (5 V\/300 mA input)\u003cbr data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1821\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4 (range \u0026gt; 10 m)\u003cbr data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1843\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1860\"\u003eAuto Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes\u003cbr data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1886\"\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e AAC, SBC\u003cbr data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1898\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1921\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.4 GHz\u003cbr data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1932\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1946\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32 Ω ± 10%\u003cbr data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1960\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1976\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 105 ± 3 dB\u003cbr data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2006\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Quad mic ENC noise cancellation\u003cbr data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2041\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2062\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2098\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2098\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2145\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2145\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2116\"\u003ePlay\/Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2189\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2161\"\u003eNext Song\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2236\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2236\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2209\"\u003ePrevious Song\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2279\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2279\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2251\"\u003eVolume +\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2321\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2321\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2294\"\u003eVolume –\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2343\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press either earbud (2 sec)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2426\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2426\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2396\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tap either earbud 4 times\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2481\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2452\"\u003eAnswer\/Hang Up Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2528\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2528\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2544\"\u003ePower Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Touch \u0026amp; hold for 7 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2580\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2616\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2616\"\u003eWhy Choose J-10 C Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2945\"\u003eJ-10 C isn't just a pair of earbuds—it's a statement. Designed to commemorate Pakistan Air Force’s iconic 6-0 victory, these earbuds merge military inspiration with top-tier functionality. Whether you're gaming, on a call, or vibing to your favorite tracks, J-10 C delivers sound with purpose. Own the legacy. Hear the victory.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50352552509718,"sku":"25746","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"J-10 C Gift Box","offer_id":51621432066326,"sku":"25884","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_38e06a8b-7a6e-481a-a837-149460b8805a.webp?v=1785237507"},{"product_id":"lunar-360-smartwatch","title":"Lunar 360 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Lunar 360 is built to keep up with your lifestyle—day and night.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy electroplated middle frame, stainless steel dual buttons, and ABS+PC bottom shell with leather-TPU strap.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.43-inch AMOLED round screen with 466×466 resolution and full-screen touch functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – 300 mAh polymer lithium battery offering:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 days of typical use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 days in AOD (Always-On Display) mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient magnetic charging method for quick and reliable power-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, music control, notifications, and remote camera functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (VC30F-S Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Multiple sport profiles supported, including running, cycling, walking, and more, with motion tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – AMOLED display supports vibrant pre-installed dials and downloadable options via companion app.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Tools \u0026amp; Assistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Voice assistant, weather, calendar, alarm, stopwatch, timer, calculator, world clock, sedentary \u0026amp; drink reminders.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – IP67 water resistance ensures safety in daily use and light water exposure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, stainless steel buttons, ABS+PC bottom shell, leather+TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.43-inch AMOLED, 466×466 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e RTL8773EWE-VP\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e SRAM 560 KB, PSRAM 4 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlash:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128 Mbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e VC30F-S heart rate \u0026amp; SpO₂ sensor, STK8321 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 mAh polymer lithium (10 days use, 30 days standby, 3 days AOD mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and more)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 65 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 53.2 × 46.5 × 12.8 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtras:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice assistant, remote camera, breathing exercises, business card holder, OTA software updates\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eWhy Choose Lunar 360 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lunar 360 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable—it’s a complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to stay on top of your health, boost your productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Lunar 360 delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP67 water resistance, it’s built for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":50407371014422,"sku":"23159","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold Silicone","offer_id":50407370850582,"sku":"23162","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silicone","offer_id":50407370981654,"sku":"23161","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50407370948886,"sku":"23157","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Leather","offer_id":50407371079958,"sku":"23160","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey Silver Silicone","offer_id":50407371047190,"sku":"23164","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Silicone","offer_id":50407371112726,"sku":"23165","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50407370916118,"sku":"23163","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":50407370883350,"sku":"23158","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/lunar_Brown-Leather_1.webp?v=1756987036"},{"product_id":"nebula-earbuds","title":"Nebula Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1 data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"188\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"497\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"212\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e bring immersive audio and intelligent connectivity together in a sleek in-ear TWS design. With hybrid ANC, crystal-clear calling, long battery life, and sensitive touch controls, Nebula is built for music lovers, professionals, and gamers who want superior sound without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"502\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"532\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"675\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"565\"\u003ePremium Design \u0026amp; Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic in-ear TWS design with lightweight build (46 g total) and stylish color options (beige, black).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"852\"\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"703\"\u003eHigh-Fidelity Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e – 13 mm drivers with 32 Ω impedance, 124±1.5 dB sensitivity, 20–20,000 Hz frequency response, and dual-channel 24-bit DAC for studio-like clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"998\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"883\"\u003eAdvanced Noise Control\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hybrid ANC + ENC for clear calls and immersive listening, plus transparency mode (long press right earbud 2s).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1106\"\u003e🎤 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003eClear Voice Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – 6 built-in microphones ensure crisp communication and call noise reduction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1147\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1143\"\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1198\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1198\"\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (up to 20 hours playtime)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eCharging Case: 400 mAh (total 20 hours use, 5 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eCharging Time: ~1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003eConvenient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – DC5V magnetic input (box: 5V 1A \/ 0.3A output).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1500\"\u003e📱 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1401\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 platform with ≥10 m range, auto-pairing, quick pairing, and master-slave switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1554\"\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1523\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sensitive touch functions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1595\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1595\"\u003ePlay\/Pause: Double-tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1625\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1625\"\u003eVolume+: Tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1654\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1654\"\u003eVolume–: Tap left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1715\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1715\"\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri\/Google): Long press left earbud 2s\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1771\"\u003eGame Mode \/ Low Latency: Quadruple-tap right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1849\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1800\"\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – IPX4 rating for splash and sweat resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1854\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1886\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1916\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1916\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1908\"\u003eProduct Model:\u003c\/strong\u003e JX116\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1945\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1945\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1930\"\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beige, Black\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1990\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1972\"\u003eEarphone Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 33 × 20 × 23 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2040\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2040\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2022\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 33 × 20 × 23 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2061\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2061\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2054\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2122\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2122\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2085\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2155\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2144\"\u003eTotal Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2184\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2175\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2217\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2217\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2205\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2331\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2331\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2244\"\u003eChipset \u0026amp; Bluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bluetooth 5.3 + BR + EDR + BLE, supports multiple protocols (A2DP, AVRCP, HFP, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2350\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6-mic system\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2408\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2408\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2384\"\u003eDriver Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2449\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2449\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2434\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20–20,000 Hz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2473\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2473\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2466\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2505\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2505\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2492\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 124±1.5 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2553\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2553\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2527\"\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e 24-bit DAC, SNR ≥102 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2584\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2584\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2577\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2681\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2681\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2600\"\u003eControls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Touch \u0026amp; button-based (play\/pause, calls, volume, voice assistant, gaming mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2786\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2700\"\u003eAccessories:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds L\/R, charging case, eartips (L\/M\/S), charging cable, color box, user manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2824\"\u003eWhy Choose Nebula Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"3124\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2848\"\u003eNebula Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are engineered for those who want more from their audio—deep bass, crisp highs, and effortless control. With hybrid ANC, IPX4 durability, 6-mic clarity, and up to 20 hours of playtime, Nebula is designed to adapt to your day, whether you’re working, gaming, or on the move.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Royal Blue","offer_id":50506882679062,"sku":"23656","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Charcoal Black","offer_id":50506882613526,"sku":"23035","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Creamy Beige","offer_id":50506882646294,"sku":"23655","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Nabula_Royal-Blue_1.webp?v=1758701929"},{"product_id":"visionary-smartwatch","title":"Visionary Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contains\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1 × ZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e1 × User Manual\u003cbr\u003e1 × Warranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Visionary is built to keep up with your lifestyle day and night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display:\u003cbr\u003e1.85-inch AMOLED HD full-touch screen with stunning clarity and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Bluetooth Calling*  Single-chip Bluetooth 5.3 delivers stable, clear call quality directly from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Customizable Watch Faces* Switch between built-in dials or cloud-based designs to suit your mood and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Comprehensive Health Tracking*  Real-time heart rate monitoring, SpO₂ tracking, sleep analysis, and female health tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Fitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes* Multiple workout profiles supported for accurate performance and activity tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Notifications \u0026amp; Controls \u003c\/strong\u003eStay updated with instant alerts and manage music, camera, and weather with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e  Designed to handle sweat, rain, and splashes for worry-free daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 15 days of typical use on a single charge for uninterrupted performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.85-inch AMOLED HD, full-touch screen\u003cbr\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and camera control)\u003cbr\u003eHealth Sensors: Heart rate, SpO₂, sleep tracking, female health monitoring\u003cbr\u003eSports: Multiple sport modes with motion tracking\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003cbr\u003eBattery Life: Up to 15 days\u003cbr\u003eCharging: Magnetic charging cable\u003cbr\u003eBuild: Stylish, durable design with premium finish\u003cbr\u003eWarranty: 365 Days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose ZERO Visionary?\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable it’s your complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to track your health, boost productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Visionary delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP68 water resistance, it’s designed for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silicone","offer_id":50583080632598,"sku":"22948","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50583080435990,"sku":"22947","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Silicone","offer_id":50583080501526,"sku":"22949","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":50583080599830,"sku":"22950","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green Silicone","offer_id":50583080534294,"sku":"22946","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50583080468758,"sku":"22951","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Orange Silicone","offer_id":50583080567062,"sku":"22952","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Visionary_Starlight-Silicone_1_a7706397-974f-479a-9934-13ea5327f478.webp?v=1774870143"},{"product_id":"evo-earbuds","title":"Evo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVO Earbuds\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds bring a bold new edge to sound and style. With a sleek metallic finish, powerful 10 mm drivers, and dual-mic ENC for crystal-clear calls, EVO is designed for those who live loud and make every beat their own. Built to match Gen Z energy, it’s where performance meets personality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Metallic Design – Glossy metallic casing with bold color options. \u003cbr\u003eLightweight 36.5 g build for everyday comfort and portability.\u003cbr\u003ePowerful Sound Performance – 10 mm dynamic drivers deliver balanced bass and crisp treble.\u003cbr\u003eENC Voice Clarity – Dual-mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) ensures clear calls even in noisy environments.\u003cbr\u003eBattery Performance –\u003cbr\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (approx. 5–6 hours playtime)\u003cbr\u003eUp to 50 Hours total play time.\u003cbr\u003eCharging Type – Type C\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Connectivity – Bluetooth 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eSmart Touch Controls –\u003cbr\u003ePlay\/Pause: Single-tap MFB button\u003cbr\u003eNext Track: Double-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003ePrevious Track: Double-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume +: Triple-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume –: Triple-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri \/ Google): Press and hold 2 s\u003cbr\u003eAnswer \/ Hang up Call: Single-tap MFB\u003cbr\u003eReject Call: Long-press 2 s MFB\u003cbr\u003eTurn Off: Press and hold 4 s\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance – IPX4 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 60.1 × 48.36 × 26.6 mm\u003cbr\u003eWeight: 36.5 g (total)\u003cbr\u003eBattery Capacity: Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003cbr\u003eTotal Playtime: 50 hours\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Range: 10 m\u003cbr\u003eDriver Size: 10 mm dynamic drivers\u003cbr\u003eMicrophones: Dual mic + ENC \u003cbr\u003eControls: Smart Touch (MFB multi-function buttons)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose EVO Earbuds?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds are engineered for those who thrive on individuality. With their metallic build, punchy 10 mm drivers, and ENC-enhanced voice clarity, EVO ensures your music and calls always sound as good as you look. Designed for expressive, everyday use. It’s not just another pair of earbuds, it’s your sound, your style, your EVO.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50630768132374,"sku":"23463","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50630768197910,"sku":"23470","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50630768165142,"sku":"23464","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ruby Red","offer_id":50630768230678,"sku":"23468","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50630768099606,"sku":"23466","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/evo_jet-back_3.webp?v=1776686260"},{"product_id":"aero-earbuds","title":"Aero Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 pair of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbud\u003c\/a\u003e, 1 charging cable, 1 user manual, 1 feature book, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero brings the essence of Zero Lifestyle’s sound engineering into a lighter, more compact form. Designed for creators, commuters, and everyday listeners, Aero delivers studio-grade clarity, seamless connectivity, and comfort that stays with you all day. Whether you’re in the zone, on the go, or winding down, Aero blends performance and elegance for the modern audio experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13mm Boosted Super Driver\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero is powered by a 13mm boosted sound driver that enhances every beat with rich depth and crisp detail, creating a balanced audio experience that brings your playlists, calls, and podcasts to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENC Function with Quad Mic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) and a Quad Mic setup, Aero ensures your voice stays crystal clear during calls, even in noisy surroundings. Ideal for remote work, content creation, and everyday communication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntegrated AI voice support lets you control music, manage calls, and check updates effortlessly, all through simple voice commands without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith just \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e45ms latency\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Aero’s gaming mode synchronizes sound and visuals in real-time for uninterrupted gameplay and a competitive edge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero connects instantly the moment you open the case; no delays, no manual reconnecting. Smart pairing technology remembers your devices for a seamless start every time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eup to 30 hours of total playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (including case) and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5 hours on a single charge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, supported by Type-C fast charging that gives \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt to handle splashes, sweat, and light rain, Aero keeps up with your workouts and outdoor routines without compromise.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eManage music, calls, and gaming mode with a gentle tap; intuitive touch control ensures zero interruptions in your flow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 5.4\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBT Range:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15m\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpeaker Unit:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 20–10kHz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 30mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Case Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 250mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 5 hours on a single charge; 30 hours total with case\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C, DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBox Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e IPX5\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm boosted drivers, ENC with Quad Mic, AI Voice Assistant, Gaming Mode (45ms Low Latency), Instant Pairing, Type-C Fast Charging, 10-min quick charge = 120-min playtime, IPX5 water resistance, Sensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Aero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds redefine what everyday audio should feel effortless, expressive, and reliable. With immersive sound, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance, Aero keeps you connected to your rhythm wherever life takes you. From daily commutes to late-night edits, from workouts to work calls, Aero delivers clarity, comfort, and confidence, the Zero way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Hyper Red","offer_id":51198922490134,"sku":"22281","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51198932222230,"sku":"22270","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space White","offer_id":51198931665174,"sku":"23064","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":51198923211030,"sku":"23063","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51198931730710,"sku":"23061","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Aero_Hyper-Red-4.webp?v=1766759359"},{"product_id":"fusion-earbuds","title":"Fusion Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1 data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"246\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"248\"\u003eFusion Earbuds – Pure Sound. Pure Freedom.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"296\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"300\"\u003eFusion Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are engineered for listeners who want powerful sound, seamless connectivity, and an ultra-comfortable in-ear design. Built with a \u003cstrong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"449\"\u003e13mm copper-ring dynamic driver\u003c\/strong\u003e, dual microphones, Bluetooth 5.4, and a premium ergonomic fit, Fusion delivers an audio experience where clarity, comfort, and convenience come together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"640\"\u003eWhether you're working out, commuting, or winding down, Fusion keeps you immersed with deep bass, crisp vocals, and stable wireless performance—all wrapped inside a sleek, pocket-friendly charging case.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"849\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"852\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"881\"\u003ePowered by a \u003cstrong data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"894\"\u003eΦ13mm copper-ring membrane speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, Fusion Earbuds deliver:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"962\"\u003eDeep, rich bass\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eClear vocals\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"999\"\u003eBalanced highs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1016\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1018\"\u003e20Hz–20kHz frequency response\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1050\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1052\"\u003e117dB sensitivity for crisp, high-resolution audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1106\"\u003ePerfect for music, movies, and calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003eCrystal-Clear Calling with Dual Mics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1197\"\u003eEach earbud features \u003cstrong data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003edual microphones\u003c\/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1244\"\u003enoise-reduction support\u003c\/strong\u003e, ensuring your voice stays loud and clear—even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1385\"\u003eEnjoy ultra-stable and fast connectivity with the latest \u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 (JL 7006F4 platform)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1486\"\u003e\u0026lt;1s Quick Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1508\"\u003eAuto Pairing on opening the case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1543\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1545\"\u003ePopup Pairing support\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003eHyper Sync for instant reconnect\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003e10m wireless transmission range\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1643\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1645\"\u003eSupports AVRCP, HFP, HSP, A2DP audio protocols\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003eAll-Day Listening Power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1732\"\u003eFusion keeps up with your routine thanks to strong battery life:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1814\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e5.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e continuous playback\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1837\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e90 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1864\"\u003eEarbud battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1889\" data-start=\"1880\"\u003e40mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1894\"\u003eCharging case battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1917\"\u003e400mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1930\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1932\"\u003eFull charge time: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1963\" data-start=\"1950\"\u003e1.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1966\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1968\"\u003eType-C fast charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1993\"\u003eCharging case input: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2022\" data-start=\"2014\"\u003e1.5W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2025\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2027\"\u003eOutput: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2035\"\u003e0.2W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2083\"\u003eDesigned to handle sweat and light rain—ideal for workouts, commuting, and daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003eComfort Meets Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2205\"\u003eFusion Earbuds feature a lightweight TWS in-ear design that fits securely without fatigue.\u003cbr data-end=\"2298\" data-start=\"2295\"\u003eAvailable in premium colors:\u003cbr data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2326\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2329\"\u003eSilver, Red, Black, Gray\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2363\"\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2391\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003eEarbuds:\u003c\/strong\u003e 23 × 25 × 29 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2410\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2430\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003eCharging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e 57 × 55.5 × 34.5 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2453\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2472\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2544\" data-start=\"2510\"\u003eFusion is built for convenience:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2547\"\u003eWake Siri \/ Google Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2580\"\u003eTouch controls (play\/pause, skip, calls)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2623\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2625\"\u003eCharging \u0026amp; status indicators\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2656\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2658\"\u003eMaster-slave switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2683\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2685\"\u003eAnti-loss prompt\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2706\"\u003eIn-ear detection (not supported—can remove if needed)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2796\"\u003eFusion Earbuds (GM06)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2820\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2822\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2848\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2864\"\u003eWarranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2880\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2882\"\u003eGift Box Packaging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2903\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2905\"\u003eLogo Sticker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2920\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2922\"\u003eWelcome Envelope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3088\" data-start=\"2964\"\u003e✔ Daily listening\u003cbr data-end=\"2984\" data-start=\"2981\"\u003e✔ Gym \u0026amp; workouts\u003cbr data-end=\"3003\" data-start=\"3000\"\u003e✔ Travel \u0026amp; commute\u003cbr data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3021\"\u003e✔ Online meetings \u0026amp; calls\u003cbr data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"3049\"\u003e✔ Students, professionals \u0026amp; gamers\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50775231463702,"sku":"23386","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":50775231430934,"sku":"23388","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50775231496470,"sku":"23391","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Black","offer_id":50775231398166,"sku":"23389","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/blue-black-1.webp?v=1771411142"},{"product_id":"opal-earbuds","title":"Opal ANC Earbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eDesigned for everyday performance and all-day comfort, these wireless earbuds deliver powerful sound, reliable connectivity, and long battery life in a sleek in-ear design. Available in \u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"433\"\u003eBlack, White, Green, and Blue\u003c\/strong\u003e, they combine modern style with advanced audio technology to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"825\"\u003ePowered by an \u003cstrong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eF11 audio unit\u003c\/strong\u003e and supporting \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"606\"\u003eSBC\/AAC audio decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e, the earbuds produce clear highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for music, calls, and streaming. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, you get faster pairing, stable connections, and low power consumption for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1105\"\u003eBuilt for convenience, the earbuds feature \u003cstrong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"\u003esensitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eauto pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"950\"\u003eindependent earbud usage\u003c\/strong\u003e with master-slave switching. Whether you’re answering calls, controlling music, or activating \u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1073\"\u003eSiri or Google Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, everything is just a tap away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1333\"\u003eWith up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e40 hours of total playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"\u003elow-latency performance\u003c\/strong\u003e, these earbuds are ideal for daily use, workouts, travel, and casual gaming — offering reliable performance wherever you go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50996504690966,"sku":"23711","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50996504658198,"sku":"23707","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50996504723734,"sku":"23709","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Opal_Beige-1.webp?v=1775561678"},{"product_id":"thunder-speaker","title":"Thunder Pro Speaker","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"430\"\u003eTurn up the energy with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"209\"\u003eThunder Speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, built to deliver powerful sound in a compact, stylish body. Designed for music lovers who want loud, clear audio on the go, the Thunder Speaker is perfect for indoor hangouts, outdoor gatherings, and everyday listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"719\"\u003eWith deep bass output, stable Bluetooth connectivity, and long-lasting battery performance, the Thunder Speaker keeps your playlists alive without interruptions. Its durable build and easy controls make it a reliable companion whether you’re chilling at home or heading out with friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51000153309462,"sku":"23304","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":51154395201814,"sku":"24003","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Thunder_Black01.webp?v=1774944134"},{"product_id":"qube-smartwatch","title":"Qube Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"489\"\u003eStay connected, active, and in control with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"269\"\u003eQube Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e, designed to blend smart technology with everyday convenience. Featuring a vibrant full-touch display and a sleek, modern design, Qube keeps your notifications, fitness tracking, and health insights right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eBuilt for daily performance, the Qube Smartwatch offers comprehensive health monitoring, smart notifications, and multiple sports modes to support your active lifestyle. Whether you're tracking workouts, managing calls, or monitoring your heart rate, Qube delivers reliable performance with long-lasting battery life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"967\"\u003eWith Bluetooth connectivity, intuitive controls, and a comfortable strap design, Qube is the perfect companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silver","offer_id":51050937254166,"sku":"23888","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":51050937155862,"sku":"23814","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":51050937188630,"sku":"23890","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Rose","offer_id":51050937221398,"sku":"23889","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CHAMPAGNE_01.webp?v=1773019308"},{"product_id":"rover-elite-earbuds","title":"Rover Elite Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRover Elite Earbuds – Power Meets Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience high-quality sound, stable connectivity, and long-lasting battery life with the Rover Elite Earbuds. Built for everyday use, these earbuds offer a perfect balance of performance and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy clear audio with deep bass and balanced output. With SBC and AAC support, the Rover Elite Earbuds deliver a smooth listening experience for music, calls, and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds provide up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a total of up to 35 hours using the charging case. Fast charging ensures the earbuds are ready in about 45 minutes, while the case takes around 1.5 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with Bluetooth 5.4, the Rover Elite Earbuds ensure a stable and fast connection with a range of over 10 meters. It also supports quick pairing and smooth device switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLow Latency Mode\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 60ms low latency, these earbuds are suitable for gaming and video streaming, keeping audio in sync with visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCall Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual microphones with ENC noise reduction help reduce background noise, providing clear voice calls in different environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPX4 rating makes the earbuds resistant to sweat and light splashes, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eControls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch controls allow you to manage music, calls, volume, and voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds feature a lightweight and ergonomic design for comfortable long-term use. Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBox Contents\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeft and right earbuds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUp to 35 hours total battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth 5.4 connectivity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow latency for gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eENC for clear calls\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable and minimal design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Shadow Black","offer_id":51123063783702,"sku":"24341","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Moss Green","offer_id":51123063750934,"sku":"24340","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Beige","offer_id":51123063816470,"sku":"24339","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Arctic Sky","offer_id":51123063849238,"sku":"23887","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Rover-blackk-3.webp?v=1774434409"},{"product_id":"flow-earbuds","title":"Flow Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds are built for seamless audio, everyday comfort, and effortless connectivity. Designed for modern lifestyles, they deliver powerful sound, smart controls, and all-day convenience in a compact form.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1sboupi\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"17djwzr\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"410\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Crisp audio with deep bass and balanced clarity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f21ur0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"548\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eNoise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reduces background noise for better focus and clearer calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hwist3\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"632\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eBluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, stable, and instant pairing with all devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1h7h2r3\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"711\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Control music, calls, and functions with a simple tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"f7ntnc\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eBuilt-in Microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e – Clear voice quality for calls and meetings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1sz22y3\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"854\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\"\u003eSingle \u0026amp; Dual Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use one or both earbuds as per your need\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"g5zfhw\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"929\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"874\"\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable and secure for long listening sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jsvptw\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\"\u003eSweat-Resistant Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Perfect for workouts and daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1v9qucm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003ePortable Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy charging anytime, anywhere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"11djg2n\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended usage with charging case backup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1hz4s1p\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"9741mt\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; lightweight design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kbxqf4\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eAuto-connect after first pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ttuwac\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1290\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iOS \u0026amp; all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"zb1b6u\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003eCharging cable included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ugwij\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003eEasy to use interface\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1472\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds combine performance, comfort, and convenience — making them the perfect everyday audio companion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Black","offer_id":51210276012310,"sku":"24419","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gray","offer_id":51210276045078,"sku":"24422","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":51210276143382,"sku":"24423","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":51210276077846,"sku":"24421","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Black","offer_id":51210276110614,"sku":"24420","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_8ae65121-2039-4166-8b07-11512d29eacd.webp?v=1776250201"},{"product_id":"wave-elite","title":"Wave Elite Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"302\"\u003eThe Wave Elite Earbuds are designed for immersive sound, stable connectivity, and all-day convenience. Built with advanced Bluetooth 5.4 technology, ENC call noise reduction, ultra-low latency gaming mode, and long battery backup, they are the perfect choice for music, calls, gaming, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"319\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"474\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"350\"\u003ePremium Sound Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Powerful 13mm dynamic drivers deliver clear audio, rich bass, and balanced sound for an immersive listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"586\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"499\"\u003eENC Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Advanced call noise reduction minimizes background sounds for clearer voice calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"718\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"618\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy faster pairing, strong wireless stability, and smooth connection with up to 10–15m range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"843\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"748\"\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effortlessly control music, calls, volume, and gaming mode with responsive touch gestures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"961\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"870\"\u003eQuad Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual microphones in each earbud provide enhanced voice pickup and better call clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"990\"\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Experience smooth and synchronized sound with ultra-fast 45ms latency for gaming and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1192\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1116\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instantly activate Siri or Google Assistant for hands-free convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1310\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1219\"\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat and splash resistant design makes them ideal for gym, workouts, and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1384\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\"\u003eQuick Pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and hassle-free connection after first setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1485\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1412\"\u003eComfortable In-Ear Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic in-ear design ensures secure fit and long-lasting comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1490\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"18thdu9\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1513\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1602\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1542\"\u003e30 Hours Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long-lasting battery backup with charging case support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1681\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1638\"\u003e5 Hours Single Charge Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable daily use on one full charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1778\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e700mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – High-capacity charging case provides multiple recharges on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1868\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1807\"\u003e1–2 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quickly recharge earbuds and case for uninterrupted use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1938\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1894\"\u003eType-C Charging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern and convenient charging support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2016\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\"\u003e100 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2021\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"7o52ou\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2044\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f2hjid\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2117\"\u003eBluetooth audio codec support for MP3, WMA, FLAC, WAV, APE and more\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"3tz66d\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2157\"\u003eAuto pairing after first connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ozwnsi\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2193\"\u003eClear 32Ω balanced audio output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1r98psv\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2245\"\u003eStylish lightweight design (40.5g total weight)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"djesr6\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2282\"\u003eAvailable in 5 attractive colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"wm71jn\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2363\"\u003eIncludes charging case, charging cable, user manual, warranty card \u0026amp; eartips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kiu9y5\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2407\"\u003eIncludes carrying pouch for portability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jp8vm0\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, tablets, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2489\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2654\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe Wave Elite Earbuds combine style, performance, and smart features — making them the ideal everyday audio companion for music lovers, gamers, and professionals.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Ruby","offer_id":51249287102742,"sku":"23521","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Creamy Beige","offer_id":51249290445078,"sku":"23524","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose gold","offer_id":51249290510614,"sku":"23526","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Breeze","offer_id":51249290412310,"sku":"23522","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Envy","offer_id":51249290477846,"sku":"23528","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_d4a07a8b-14fd-4911-baf6-1843bbdce0c2.webp?v=1777272712"},{"product_id":"halo-pro","title":"Halo Pro Headphones","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"481\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones are designed for immersive audio, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance. Featuring hybrid ANC + ENC technology, large 40mm drivers, ultra-low latency, and extended battery life, they deliver a premium listening experience for music, calls, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"498\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"695\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"539\"\u003eHybrid ANC + ENC Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e – Advanced active noise cancellation combined with environmental noise reduction minimizes external noise for a focused listening and calling experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"816\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"718\"\u003eDual 40mm Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Equipped with powerful 2×40mm drivers for deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"921\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"848\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stable and fast wireless connection with a range of up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"956\"\u003eUltra-Low Latency Mode (20ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Seamless audio synchronization for gaming and video streaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1128\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1053\"\u003ePhysical Button Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy and precise control over music, calls, volume, and ANC functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1222\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\"\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Resistant to sweat and light splashes, suitable for daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1310\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eQuick Pairing Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Red and blue LED indicators guide fast and easy connection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"18thdu9\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1338\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1420\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1361\"\u003e45 Hours Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long-lasting battery life for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1499\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1449\"\u003e500mAh Battery Capacity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Powerful built-in battery for extended usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1577\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003e50 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1653\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1604\"\u003e4 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharge with Type-C charging support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1732\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1674\"\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern and reliable charging interface (DC 5V input).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1khwwct\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1761\"\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1847\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1795\"\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-range audio for deep bass and crisp highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1920\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1866\"\u003e32Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Balanced sound output with efficient power usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1993\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1943\"\u003e105dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Loud and clear sound with minimal distortion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2073\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2017\"\u003e3 Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enhanced voice clarity for calls and communication.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2168\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2100\"\u003e-22dB Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effective background noise suppression for better call quality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2173\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1jb9d1k\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2192\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"jvqds4\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2258\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2212\"\u003ePower On\/Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold power button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1tlx6uk\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2300\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2277\"\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1vdv5mg\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2359\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kuabcm\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2422\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume – for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"kzm9yj\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2472\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2443\"\u003eVolume Control\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tap Volume + \/ – buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ucahzf\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2513\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2490\"\u003eAnswer Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"101am5u\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2559\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2531\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jzrfgp\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2612\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2576\"\u003eANC ON\/OFF\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press wave button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1dpk2m0\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2657\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2628\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single press wave button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"iftlyf\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2677\"\u003eFactory Reset\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + and Volume – for 5 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"7o52ou\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2760\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1p2vn9c\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2808\"\u003ePremium over-ear wireless headphone design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ldrgqs\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2865\"\u003eLightweight build (~221.5g) for comfortable long use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1pw00nu\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2918\"\u003eErgonomic structure for better fit and stability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ukt9rp\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2979\"\u003eBluetooth protocol support for wide device compatibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1c0pp1i\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3030\"\u003eLED indicators for charging and pairing status\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1n1neu5\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3098\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"19256mj\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3148\"\u003eIncludes headphones and Type-C charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hhhy1b\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003eAvailable in Black, Green, and Gold colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3200\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3394\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones combine powerful sound, intelligent noise cancellation, and long battery life — making them the perfect choice for users who want a premium wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose gold","offer_id":51262216339734,"sku":"24160","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":51262216274198,"sku":"24159","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Matt Black","offer_id":51262216306966,"sku":"24158","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Army Green","offer_id":51262216241430,"sku":"24161","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Halo_Pro_1.webp?v=1777723827"},{"product_id":"jewel-pro","title":"Jewel Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eJewel Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a premium alloy body and a comfortable 18mm strap, the Jewel Pro carries a sleek 38.9mm dial while staying impressively light at just 29g. Built to handle daily life, it carries an IP68 water resistance rating so it keeps up with you through sweat, splashes, and rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy a larger 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with a sharp 390×390 resolution that delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and excellent clarity. With customizable menu view styles and an always-on display option, every glance feels premium.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by a 170mAh polymer battery, the Jewel Pro offers around 3 days of active use and up to 20 days on standby. Convenient magnetic wire charging tops it up fully in just 2 hours, getting you back on the move without delay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; NFC\u003c\/strong\u003e Take and make calls directly from your wrist thanks to the built-in speaker and Bluetooth calling chip. The integrated NFC support adds an extra layer of everyday convenience, keeping essential functions right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/strong\u003e Effortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts straight from your wrist. With contact synchronization, call records, incoming call and message alerts, split-screen functionality, and find-device\/find-phone tools, the Jewel Pro ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your experience with 91+ cloud-based watch faces (around 6 built-in), animated watch faces, and DIY watch face support — and choose from 120+ sports modes (15–20 built-in). Additional smart tools include Siri voice assistant support, music playback and control through the watch speaker, camera control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, LCD brightness adjustment, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture wake, theme modes, stopwatch\/countdown, the built-in 2048 game, OTA firmware upgrades, and helpful reminders for sedentary behavior, hydration, and low battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with 390×390 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 170mAh polymer battery — around 3 days active use, 20 days standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours (magnetic wire charging).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 6.0+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e BT3.0 \/ BLE 5.4 with a 25-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e NFC support and Bluetooth calling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128M.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLanguages:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 supported languages.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Pro Smartwatch brings together refined design, a brilliant AMOLED display, and genuinely useful smart connectivity. With Bluetooth calling, NFC, comprehensive health tracking, and a deep set of everyday tools, it keeps you connected and in control — whether you're working out, powering through your day, or winding down at night.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver Gold Ring","offer_id":51268424925462,"sku":"24567","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple Ring","offer_id":51268424958230,"sku":"24571","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Ring","offer_id":51268424892694,"sku":"24569","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ANGLE_01.webp?v=1782288247"},{"product_id":"klarity-zbuds","title":"Klarity Zbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eKlarity Zbuds – True Wireless Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Klarity Zbuds are designed for immersive audio, intelligent noise cancellation, and all-day comfort. Featuring ENC technology, precision 10mm drivers, Bluetooth 5.4, and a compact charging case with extended battery life, they deliver a premium wireless audio experience for music, calls, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENC Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e – Environmental Noise Cancellation technology filters out background noise for cleaner, more natural call quality in any environment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10mm Dynamic Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Precision-tuned drivers deliver deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound for an immersive listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and stable wireless connection with a range of over 10 meters for uninterrupted audio.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Mode (60ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth audio-video synchronization for gaming, streaming, and video calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Intuitive tap-based controls for music playback, calls, volume, and voice assistant — right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat-proof and splash-resistant, built for workouts and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Pairing \u0026amp; Hyper Sync\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instant device recognition with seamless left-right earbud synchronization every time you open the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and easy connection with minimal setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Works with Siri and Google Assistant for convenient hands-free control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e26 Hours Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 5.5 hours per charge, with the charging case delivering multiple top-ups for a total of 26 hours of listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e35mAh Earbud Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient built-in battery in each earbud for consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e400mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compact and powerful case that keeps your earbuds ready on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient power management for extended use between charges.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3.5 Hours Call Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stay connected longer with optimized battery performance during calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quick and convenient recharge via Type-C cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern, reversible charging interface (5V \/ 1A input).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-spectrum audio reproduction for deep lows and crisp highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e26Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient power delivery for clear, balanced sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e108dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Rich, detailed audio with minimal distortion at any volume.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSBC \u0026amp; AAC Audio Decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e – Wide codec support for high-quality wireless audio across all devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4-Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual mics per earbud for superior voice pickup during calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower On\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 3 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 8 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double-click either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple-click Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple-click Left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Up\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single-click Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Down\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single-click Left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer \/ Hang Up Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double-click Left or Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Left or Right earbud (2 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Right earbud (3 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Left earbud (3 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold both earbuds simultaneously for 5 seconds while paired; device will power off once reset is successful\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact in-ear true wireless design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal weight: 42.7g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic fit with S\/M\/L ear tip sizes included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth protocols: A2DP, AVCTP, AVDTP, AVRCP, HFP, SPP, RFCOMM, PNP, HID, SDP, L2CAP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, laptops, and all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes earbuds (L+R), charging case, Type-C charging cable, and S\/M\/L ear tips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Orange, White, Green, Blue, and Red\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Klarity Zbuds combine powerful sound, smart noise cancellation, and an ultra-portable design — making them the perfect companion for music lovers, remote workers, and active users who demand a premium wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Red Glassy","offer_id":51268421386518,"sku":"24413","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White Glassy","offer_id":51268421419286,"sku":"24414","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Glassy","offer_id":51268421353750,"sku":"24412","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Beige Glassy","offer_id":51268421320982,"sku":"24411","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Klarity_4_19f547f1-f0bc-4846-b314-24e754ce2c28.webp?v=1779275470"},{"product_id":"10000mah-power-bank","title":"Voltix V-200 Power Bank","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVoltix V-200 Power Bank\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMetal Housing Build\u003c\/strong\u003e The Voltix V-200 is built with a solid metal housing that delivers a premium feel and dependable durability. At a compact 100×64.5×31.5mm and 314g, it's dense with power yet sized to travel comfortably in a bag, pocket, or glovebox.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20000mAh Dual-Cell Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e Two Li-Polymer cells (NV 1376074) give the V-200 a full 20000mAh battery capacity with a matching 20000mAh rated capacity — real, usable power to keep your phone, earbuds, tablet, and accessories going through long days, flights, and weekends away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e22.5W QC Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e QC fast charging support at 22.5W means compatible devices refill quickly instead of trickling along. Backed by the 04.0018017010001 main PCBA IC, power delivery stays consistent from the first percent to the last.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20W PD Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e PD fast charging at 20W lets the V-200 push high-speed power to modern USB-C phones, tablets, and accessories — exactly the standard your newer devices are built around.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Output, Charge Two at Once\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C output delivers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, and 12V\/1.67A, while USB output covers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, and 12V\/1.5A. With both Type-C and USB outputs onboard, you can power two devices side by side.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType-C Input Recharging\u003c\/strong\u003e Refill the V-200 through its Type-C input at DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, or 12V\/1.5A — one modern cable, in and out, no adapters to hunt for.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal housing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Li-Polymer cell\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity of Cell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCell Number:\u003c\/strong\u003e NV 1376074\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMain PCBA IC:\u003c\/strong\u003e 04.0018017010001\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRated Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, 12V\/1.67A; USB — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C \u0026amp; USB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQC Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 22.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePD Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100×64.5×31.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 314g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Voltix V-200 Power Bank?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Voltix V-200 pairs a rugged metal housing with a genuine 20000mAh dual-cell battery and fast, flexible charging. With 22.5W QC and 20W PD support, dual Type-C and USB outputs, and a compact 314g frame, it's built for people who need real power without carrying a brick — commuters, travelers, and anyone who's tired of hunting for an outlet.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51512764530966,"sku":"24639","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":51512764563734,"sku":"24649","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gradient Green","offer_id":51512764596502,"sku":"24650","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_1_7d4e6045-ad20-4846-8947-a806df24d135.webp?v=1783601752"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/collections\/Main-banner_1.webp?v=1739772600","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/collections\/all-products-1.oembed","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}